# CONFIG_RZV_DTC intentionally removed.
# DTC peripheral does NOT exist on RZ/V2H (R9A09G057H). There is no
# DTC iodefine for R9A09G057H. The old RZV_DTC_BASE (0x11400400) overlapped
# DMAC0 group-1 registers and would have caused silent register corruption.

